{"unit_id":"Bozheng-Li__dsh-system-proxy#card-zh","repo":"Bozheng-Li/dsh-system-proxy","commit":"ac1731a4779375c51131653bb5d4bd4350fee35b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH System Proxy 是面向 Windows 上 DSH 的系统代理插件，可让 DSH 的 HTTP 请求沿用当前用户配置的代理。它通过 bundle patch 注册插件，在启动时读取 WinINET 设置，并为 undici 安装进程级代理 dispatcher，同时向派生进程提供代理环境变量。它支持自动跟随系统代理、手动指定代理地址或关闭代理，也能合并 Windows 绕过列表。适合需要让 DSH 请求和相关命令行子进程共用 Windows HTTP 代理的用户；需要 Windows 环境和可用的 HTTP 代理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-47","lib/system-proxy.js:145-204","lib/proxy-policy.js:16-44","cordis.patch.yml:12-14"]}
{"unit_id":"Bozheng-Li__dsh-system-proxy#card-en","repo":"Bozheng-Li/dsh-system-proxy","commit":"ac1731a4779375c51131653bb5d4bd4350fee35b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH System Proxy routes DSH HTTP traffic through the current Windows user’s proxy. A startup hook reads WinINET settings, configures undici and passes proxy variables to child processes. It supports automatic or manual selection, bypass entries and an off mode. For Windows users with an HTTP proxy.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-47","lib/system-proxy.js:145-204","lib/proxy-policy.js:16-44","cordis.patch.yml:12-14"]}
