{"unit_id":"Bozheng-Li__dsh-system-proxy#feature-1","repo":"Bozheng-Li/dsh-system-proxy","commit":"ac1731a4779375c51131653bb5d4bd4350fee35b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH System Proxy** 的功能「auto」：自动读取 Windows 当前用户的 WinINET 代理设置，解析普通地址和按 HTTP、HTTPS 区分的代理项，并将结果用于 DSH 网络请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/system-proxy.js:145-204"]}
{"unit_id":"Bozheng-Li__dsh-system-proxy#feature-2","repo":"Bozheng-Li/dsh-system-proxy","commit":"ac1731a4779375c51131653bb5d4bd4350fee35b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH System Proxy** 的功能「manual」：可在插件配置中选择 manual 模式并提供 proxyUrl，让 DSH 使用指定的 HTTP 代理；off 模式则停用代理配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/system-proxy.js:211-248"]}
{"unit_id":"Bozheng-Li__dsh-system-proxy#feature-3","repo":"Bozheng-Li/dsh-system-proxy","commit":"ac1731a4779375c51131653bb5d4bd4350fee35b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH System Proxy** 的功能「dispatch」：启用时安装 undici 全局 dispatcher，按 HTTP 或 HTTPS 选择代理，并为绕过的目标使用直连 agent。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/proxy-policy.js:16-44"]}
{"unit_id":"Bozheng-Li__dsh-system-proxy#feature-4","repo":"Bozheng-Li/dsh-system-proxy","commit":"ac1731a4779375c51131653bb5d4bd4350fee35b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH System Proxy** 的功能「children」：把代理地址和绕过列表写入进程环境变量，使 DSH 派生的子进程也能读取代理配置；清理时恢复原环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/proxy-policy.js:55-86"]}
{"unit_id":"Bozheng-Li__dsh-system-proxy#caveat-1","repo":"Bozheng-Li/dsh-system-proxy","commit":"ac1731a4779375c51131653bb5d4bd4350fee35b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH System Proxy 只在 Windows 上检测系统代理；检测到 PAC URL 或自动发现时会返回不支持状态，不会解析 PAC/WPAD。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/system-proxy.js:145-204"]}
